// seraphhorizons' GearConsumers switch (README.md, GearConsumers.cs; #473): the rusty gear is salvage
// and money, so every recipe that took one takes the pack's stainless gear (seraphhorizons:gear-stainless),
// in the same number (counts below are per recipe, all slots). tools/tests/test_gear_consumers.py
// holds this file to the mod's recipes.
// Immersive Woodworking (1.3.11): the sawmill carriage, 1. The file ships disabled and the mod
// registers the recipe itself from it, once per wood, after the patch loader, as
// woodworking-machine-costs.json relies on.
[
  {"file": "immersivewoodworking:recipes/grid/sawmill_carriage.json", "op": "replace", "path": "/ingredients/G/code", "value": "seraphhorizons:gear-stainless", "dependsOn": [{"modid": "immersivewoodworking"}]}
]
